{
  "title": "Nutty Syrian Lentil Pilaf",
  "description": "A cozy and crunchy Syrian dish featuring lentils, nuts, and a spicy kick, made with a mother-sauce base and flexitarian-friendly ingredients, this recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
  "diet": [
